 "schematicNotes": [
  {
   "id": "note_intro",
   "text": "POWER harness - ECU focused. Battery and fuses in the passenger footwell. 12V / +5V / +8V / Gnd Out / chassis. Display devices are CAN-only and are not powered from this harness. Signals: ST185-Signal.harness.",
   "width": 390,
   "schematicPosition": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": -420
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "shdr_0",
   "text": "CABIN - source, fuses, relays",
   "color": "Green",
   "width": 270,
   "schematicPosition": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": -150
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "shdr_1",
   "text": "SPLICES + ECU PINS",
   "color": "Red",
   "width": 270,
   "schematicPosition": {
    "x": 1050,
    "y": -150
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "shdr_2",
   "text": "ENGINE + REAR LOADS",
   "color": "Orange",
   "width": 270,
   "schematicPosition": {
    "x": 2160,
    "y": -150
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "n_heavy",
   "width": 390,
   "schematicPosition": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": -1950
   },
   "text": "HEAVY DC - drawn separately at the top. Battery and all fusing live in the cabin (passenger footwell). Battery + to starter B+ and battery - to engine block cross the firewall on RADLOK bulkheads, 2 AWG. Alternator B+ (rear of block, under the intake) joins at the starter B+ post and does not cross. Nothing else heavy crosses."
  }
 ],
